course: dictionary
lesson: 15890
title: Uninvited: arriving without being asked
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: «Uninvited» means not invited. An uninvited guest is someone who comes without being asked. «An uninvited guest turned up at the birthday party.» The guest was not on the list, so the word tells you they were not asked.
explain: «Uninvited» can also tell you how someone does something. «The cat walked uninvited into the kitchen.» Nobody asked the cat in, so uninvited describes how it came in.
explain: Context clues help you check. Ask what would fit. The words «turned up» and «walked into» show that someone arrived, and the word uninvited tells you they were not asked. Try your meaning in the sentence to see if it makes sense.
fact: «Uninvited» means not invited; coming or happening without being asked.
fact: «Uninvited» is an adjective in «an uninvited guest», and an adverb in «He came uninvited».
fact: Common phrases are «uninvited guest», «turn up uninvited» and «come uninvited».
fact: In fairy tales, an uninvited guest often arrives at a party and causes trouble.
fact: Uninvited visitors, and messages from strangers online, should always be told to a trusted adult.
exercise: «An uninvited guest turned up at the birthday party.» What does uninvited mean here? | Late for dinner | Invited with a card | Very happy to be there | *Not invited, arriving without being asked
exercise: Mum says, «Do not let strangers in if they come uninvited.» What does come uninvited mean? | Arrive with a present | Come in a big group | *Arrive without being asked | Stay for a very long time
exercise: Which word means the opposite of uninvited? | unknown | guest | *invited | happy
test: «The dog ran into the garden uninvited.» Uninvited here means | *Without being asked | Asked politely to come in | Carried in a basket
test: Emma gets an uninvited message from a stranger online. What should she do? | *Tell a trusted adult | Forward it to all her friends | Reply to say hello | Keep it secret
exam: Ben wandered in uninvited and sat on the sofa. What does uninvited tell us about how Ben came in? | He came very quickly | He came with a friend | He came in a car | *He came without being asked
